    "original_instruction": "You have received a chargeback notification from the payment processor.\n\nPlease complete the following tasks:\n1. Read the chargeback notification email from chargebacks@paymentprocessor.com\n2. Find the Titan Manufacturing account in the CRM\n3. Create a Case titled \"Chargeback Alert - Titan Manufacturing - $8,750\" with Critical priority\n4. Include in the case description: Chargeback reason (Unauthorized transaction), amount ($8,750), and transaction ID (CB-2024-77123)\n5. Post an urgent alert to the #billing-alerts Slack channel\n6. Send an email to the customer (ap@titanmanufacturing.com) requesting transaction verification",
