    "agent_final_response": "\n\nI have successfully completed all the chargeback handling tasks. Here's a summary of what was done:\n\n## ✅ Task Completion Summary\n\n### 1. Chargeback Notification Email\n- **Found**: Email from chargebacks@paymentprocessor.com (ID: 5AqSWT7HuB9e5xnwMwS7yv)\n- **Subject**: URGENT: Chargeback Filed - Titan Manufacturing - $8,750\n- **Details**: Transaction ID CB-2024-77123, Unauthorized transaction, $8,750.00, Response deadline: February 10, 2026\n\n### 2. Titan Manufacturing Account\n- **Found**: Account ID `c3d0204e-f42f-552a-a8eb-379525cbbfd3`\n- **Industry**: Manufacturing\n- **Location**: Cleveland, USA\n\n### 3. Case Created\n- **Case ID**: `c19102f8-0bd1-d78a-e41b-6acf4fa706cf`\n- **Title**: \"Chargeback Alert - Titan Manufacturing - $8,750\"\n- **Priority**: P1 (Critical)\n- **Status**: Open_New\n- **Linked Account**: Titan Manufacturing\n\n### 4. Case Description Includes:\n- ✅ Chargeback reason: Unauthorized transaction\n- ✅ Amount: $8,750\n- ✅ Transaction ID: CB-2024-77123\n- ✅ Additional details from notification email\n\n### 5. Slack Alert Posted\n- **Channel**: #billing-alerts\n- **Message ID**: M0001\n- **Content**: Urgent alert with all chargeback details and action items\n\n### 6. Customer Email Sent\n- **To**: ap@titanmanufacturing.com\n- **Subject**: URGENT: Transaction Verification Request - Chargeback CB-2024-77123 ($8,750)\n- **Content**: Professional request for transaction verification including transaction details and deadline information\n\nAll chargeback handling tasks have been completed promptly. The case is now tracking in the CRM, the team has been alerted via Slack, and the customer has been contacted for verification.",
