      "action": "send_email(body=\"Dear Titan Manufacturing Accounts Payable Team,\n\nRE: Transaction Verification Request - URGENT\n\nWe are writing to you regarding a recent transaction that has been disputed through your credit card provider. We take this matter very seriously and are conducting an immediate investigation.\n\nTransaction Details:\n- Transaction ID: CB-2024-77123\n- Amount: $8,750.00\n- Dispute Reason: Unauthorized Transaction\n\nTo assist us in resolving this matter promptly, we kindly request that you verify the following:\n\n1. Was this transaction of $8,750.00 authorized by your organization?\n2. Was the purchase made for legitimate business purposes?\n3. If authorized, could you please provide any supporting documentation (purchase order, invoice, or authorization confirmation)?\n\nGiven the response deadline imposed by your payment processor (February 10, 2026), we kindly request your prompt response to help us resolve this chargeback efficiently.\n\nIf you did NOT authorize this transaction, please inform us immediately so we can take appropriate action.\n\nPlease reply to this email with your verification as soon as possible. If you have any questions or need to discuss this matter further, please do not hesitate to contact us.\n\nThank you for your immediate attention to this urgent matter.\n\nBest regards,\nFraud Prevention Team\nYour Company\", from_email=\"fraud.team@company.com\", subject=\"URGENT: Transaction Verification Request - Chargeback CB-2024-77123 ($8,750)\", to=\"ap@titanmanufacturing.com\")",
      "metadata": {
